# Dev reference copy — canonical unit is templated by the native-apps Ansible
# role in the homelab repo (awairelement-basement.service.j2). Its own unit so a
# hung sensor read can't stall the Awair or outdoor pollers, and vice versa.
#
# Manual install (non-Ansible boxes):
#   ln -sf ~/sources/awairelement/systemd/awairelement-basement.service ~/.config/systemd/user/
#   systemctl --user daemon-reload && systemctl --user enable --now awairelement-basement
[Unit]
Description=Awair Element basement (ESPHome) temperature poller
After=network-online.target

[Service]
WorkingDirectory=%h/sources/awairelement
ExecStart=%h/sources/awairelement/.venv/bin/python -m awair.basement
EnvironmentFile=-%h/.config/awairelement/environment
Restart=always
RestartSec=30

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
